enable
configure terminal
hostname rt3

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0
description to core3
ip address 172.16.90.2 255.255.255.252
ip nat inside
no shutdown
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2
description to uplink
ip address 203.0.113.6 255.255.255.252
ip nat outside
no shutdown

ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 203.0.113.5
ip route 172.16.0.0 255.255.0.0 172.16.90.1

access-list 110 deny   ip 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255
access-list 110 permit ip 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255 any
ip nat inside source list 110 interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2 overload

access-list 101 permit ip 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255

crypto isakmp policy 10
encryption aes 256
hash sha
authentication pre-share
group 2
lifetime 86400

crypto isakmp key VPNkey123 address 203.0.113.1

crypto ipsec transform-set TS esp-aes 256 esp-sha-hmac

crypto map VPN-MAP 10 ipsec-isakmp
description VPN to office 2
set peer 203.0.113.1
set transform-set TS
match address 101


interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2
crypto map VPN-MAP

end
write memory